---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy | Isaac Assistant" description="Privacy policy for Isaac Assistant.">
	<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
	<p class="muted">Last updated: 27 September 2026</p>

	<p><strong>Isaac Assistant</strong> is a private application for personal use. It is not offered to the public.</p>

	<h2>Data accessed</h2>
	<p>With the account holder's consent through Google sign-in, the application may access Gmail and Google Calendar data.</p>

	<h2>How data is used</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Data is used only to provide the application's features to the account holder.</li>
		<li>Data is not sold, shared with third parties, or used for advertising.</li>
		<li>Data is not retained by the application beyond what is needed to provide its features.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		Use of information received from Google APIs follows the
		<a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>,
		including the Limited Use requirements.
	</p>

	<h2>Revoking access</h2>
	<p>
		Access can be removed at any time from
		<a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">Google Account → Third-party connections</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact</h2>
	<p>Contact via <a href="https://github.com/isaacegglestone">GitHub</a>.</p>
</Base>
